  "notes": [
    "**Mirar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Often used reflexively: **mirarse** (to look at oneself / to look at each other)",
    "Difference from **ver**: **mirar** = to look at (deliberately), **ver** = to see (perceive)",
    "Common usage: *mirar la televisión* (to watch TV), *mirarse en el espejo* (to look at oneself in the mirror)",
    "**Mirarse fijamente** = to stare at each other intently"
  ],
